  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosa Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:49:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra, good morning. Well, almost afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:49:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Yes, hello, can you hear me? I'm on speaker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:49:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:49:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me explain. My neighbor has a dog that barks all day and into the night. It has been going on since before the holidays. Hello? Are you still there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still here, I'm listening. Where is this happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:49:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 369 Spring Street. The dog is next door, in the yard. [line breaks up] ...even after the snow and rain this week, it's out there barking. Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:49:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm here, you broke up a little. Out in the yard in that weather, ugh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:49:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. So what are the quiet hours? Is there a time it's supposed to stop? Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here. Generally the city has quiet hours overnight, but I don't want to give you the wrong times off the top of my head. Let me take your name and number and have someone who handles noise complaints call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:50:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Rosa Valdez, 401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:50:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Rosa Valdez, at 369 Spring Street, barking dog. Someone will call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:50:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I'd appreciate it."
    }
  ],
